          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūshinga ivyagezwe, ari we mucamanza, n’Imwe gusa; ni yo ishobora kurokora no guhonnya: ariko wewe ur’ iki, uhinyura mugenzawe?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.4.12",
